@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@voiceId = Mia
@outputDir = ./tmp

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### TTS - default voice, WAV output
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "你好，这是一段用于快速测试小米 MiMo TTS 服务的文本。",
  "format": "wav",
  "isStream": false
}

### TTS - preset voice with style controls
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "今天的天气不错，适合出门散步，也适合在家里安静地读一本书。",
  "voiceId": "{{voiceId}}",
  "format": "wav",
  "styleInstruction": "语速自然，情绪温和，停顿清晰。",
  "audioTagStyle": "(温柔)",
  "isStream": false
}

### TTS - streaming PCM16 output
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "这是一个流式 PCM16 输出测试。",
  "voiceId": "{{voiceId}}",
  "format": "pcm16",
  "isStream": true
}

### TTS - voice design from prompt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "这段音频用于测试根据音色描述生成新音色。",
  "voicePrompt": "年轻女性声音，清澈自然，普通话标准，语气亲切。",
  "format": "wav",
  "styleInstruction": "保持自然叙述感，不要夸张。",
  "optimizeTextPreview": true,
  "isStream": false
}

### TTS - multipart text file
# Replace ./article.txt with a real UTF-8 text file before sending.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textFile"; filename="article.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./article.txt
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="voiceId"

{{voiceId}}
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="format"

wav
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isStream"

false
--boundary--

### TTS - multipart voice clone file
# Replace ./article.txt and ./sample.mp3 with real files before sending.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textFile"; filename="article.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./article.txt
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="voiceCloneFile"; filename="sample.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./sample.mp3
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="format"

wav
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isStream"

false
--boundary--

### TTS - validation error: multiple voice inputs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "这个请求用于验证错误处理。",
  "voiceId": "{{voiceId}}",
  "voicePrompt": "低沉男声",
  "format": "wav"
}

### TTS - role preset (references src/voices.config.ts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "欢迎收听今晚的午夜电台，我是陪你入睡的声音。",
  "roleId": "午夜电台",
  "format": "wav",
  "isStream": false
}

### TTS - style preset (references src/stylePresets.ts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "全村的希望，冲鸭！这波必须整起来！",
  "stylePreset": "东北话",
  "format": "wav",
  "isStream": false
}

### TTS - singing mode (only mimo-v2.5-tts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "原谅我这一生不羁放纵爱自由，也会怕有一天会跌倒。",
  "voiceId": "Mia",
  "singing": true,
  "format": "wav",
  "isStream": false
}

### TTS - streaming WAV container (no client-side PCM header needed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/tools/tts?container=wav
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "这是一个流式 WAV 封装测试。",
  "format": "pcm16",
  "isStream": true
}

### List preset voices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/voices
